GNIRS DC SDSU/ARC timing-board firmware
=======================================

Built and published by gemini-rtsw-ci: every push to main packages the
committed .lod files as the gnirsdc-dsp RPM, installed to
/gem_base/epics/ioc/gnirsdc-dsp/gnirsdc-firmware.

CI does not assemble the firmware. The DSP56K assembler runs under
gemini-wine, which is not in the gemini-rtsw rpm-repo. To change firmware:

1) WINE_IMAGE=<image with gemini-wine> ./build-firmware.sh
   (or `make firmware` where gemini-wine is installed)

2) commit the updated FullFrame-unified-*/ *.lod files

3) open a pull request; merging to main publishes the RPM

NOTE: the AladdinIII .lod here is a 2022 build. The production firmware the
GNIRS DC loads lives in gnirsdc-data-manager (src/firmware), with its source.
